    2. comserv.conf carries <Inventory> with catalog_language / translate_enabled
       / translate_model.
    3. local ollama is reachable and the configured translate_model is pulled.
  Gemma-family models are thinking models: TextTranslate sends think => false. A
  call without it burns num_predict on the reasoning trace and returns an EMPTY
